{"id":1484,"title":"*args 和 **kwargs的用途？","summary":"*args 和 **kwargs的用途？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3946253b-0c8f-35c5-a198-07c7fbb559b7","knowledge_id":166,"title":"*args 和 **kwargs的用途？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":166,"title":"*args 和 **kwargs的用途？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"806cb5e7-1a34-3f62-90aa-96ec231bb662","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，可以在函数中使用`*args`和 `**kwargs`来获取任意数量的参数。\n\n比如在定义函数时使用 `*args` 作为参数，就可以传递任意数量的参数。所有传递的参数都以**元组**的形式存储在`args`中。\n\n这是因为星形表达式`*`用于**解包缩任何可迭代对象**（如列表和元组）。`args `这个名称是可以任意命名的，但一般作为标准固定使用。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，可以在函数中使用<code>*args</code>和 <code>**kwargs</code>来获取任意数量的参数。</p>\n<p>比如在定义函数时使用 <code>*args</code> 作为参数，就可以传递任意数量的参数。所有传递的参数都以<strong>元组</strong>的形式存储在<code>args</code>中。</p>\n<p>这是因为星形表达式<code>*</code>用于<strong>解包缩任何可迭代对象</strong>（如列表和元组）。<code>args</code>这个名称是可以任意命名的，但一般作为标准固定使用。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"32e35ed5-bc19-378e-b8fc-89d6cebec70e","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def fun(*args):\n    # 参数为*args，其中args是一个元组\n    print(args)\n\n\nfun(3, 2, 1)\n\n# 输出: (3, 2, 1)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"18076ed3-f220-3345-8906-7f07ca8e0d9d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"同样，`**kwargs `用于收集任意数量的关键字参数，并作为**字典**存储在 `kwargs`变量中。\n\n这是因为 `**` 是用来拆开字典的键和值的。同样，`kwargs`是一个任意的名称，但一般作为标准固定使用。\n\n**例如:**","text_html":"<p>同样，<code>**kwargs</code>用于收集任意数量的关键字参数，并作为<strong>字典</strong>存储在 <code>kwargs</code>变量中。</p>\n<p>这是因为 <code>**</code> 是用来拆开字典的键和值的。同样，<code>kwargs</code>是一个任意的名称，但一般作为标准固定使用。</p>\n<p><strong>例如:</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"48367784-894f-31e1-b438-cd6f02f4b2fe","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def fun(**kwargs):\n    ## **kwargs表示关键字参数，其中kwargs是一个字典\n    print(kwargs)\n\n\nfun(name='john', age=30)\n\n# 输出: {'name': 'john', 'age': 30}","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1484"}
